Definition.
- In these Rules unless the context otherwise requires.-
(i)
"Act" means Societies Registration Act, 1860;
(ii)
"Section" means Section of the Act;
(iii)
"IG Registration" means Inspector General of Registration as appointed under Indian Registration Act, 1908;
(iv)
"Form" means - Forms appended to this Rules;
(v)
BISCORE means Bihar Society for Computerization of Registration Offices;
(vi)
DISCORE means District Society for Computerization of Registration Offices;
(vii)
"Online Proforma" means "Online Proforma" as indicated at Form A.
